Alembic migrations for the TriageAI backend.

Run them as the database owner, from the `backend/` directory:

    alembic upgrade head          # apply
    alembic downgrade base        # reverse
    alembic upgrade head --sql    # review the SQL without running it

The URL comes from MIGRATION_DATABASE_URL (the owner account). The application
itself connects as the restricted `triageai_app` role created by
0002_db_protections, which cannot UPDATE or DELETE audit_log and cannot UPDATE
owner_descriptions (FR-05, FR-43, ADR-12).

Conventions (CLAUDE.md §11): at most one migration per subphase, named after
the subphase.
